# Build context is the repo root (see webapp/backend/Dockerfile). Keep it small — only the
# backend source + the 3 live-inference models under models/ are actually needed in the image.
#
# NOTE: unlike .gitignore, a bare "*.ext" pattern here is NOT recursive — it only matches the
# context root. Use "**/" prefixes for anything that might exist in a subdirectory (verified by
# building against this file and inspecting the resulting context — see chat history).
.git
.git/**

**/*.csv
**/*.ipynb
**/*.pdf
**/*.docx
**/~$*.docx
**/*.png
**/*.xlsx
**/__pycache__
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.pyc
**/.env

backups/
backups/**

webapp/frontend/
webapp/frontend/**

.agents/
.agents/**
.claude/
.claude/**
.github/
.github/**
CLAUDE.md
notes.py
skills-lock.json
**/.DS_Store

# Top-level models/ is 1.2GB (all 8 trained models); only these 3 are used for live inference.
# (This is a file-level exclude, not a directory-level one — negating individual files here
# does NOT have the same "re-includes everything" problem a `!models/` directory negation has.)
models/*.pkl
!models/xgb_best.pkl
!models/xgb_isotonic.pkl
!models/lr_best.pkl
